//RS /// Lower a checked App route/boundary/loader/server-function handler.  Named
//RS /// handlers become the send-safe borrow callback (`Fn(&A, &B) -> R`) so the
//RS /// one runtime adapter per arity decodes each typed input; sema has already
//RS /// rejected every non-named handler (E2810).
